        <a href="https://github.com/MCLifeLeader/CS235" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CS235</a> show earlier C and C++ work and
        data structures foundations. Java work is visible in <a href="https://github.com/MCLifeLeader/CS246" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CS246</a>
        and <a href="https://github.com/MCLifeLeader/cs313java" target="_blank" rel="noopener">cs313java</a>. Web fundamentals and
        front-end growth are represented by <a href="https://github.com/MCLifeLeader/Cit261" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Cit261</a>,
        <a href="https://github.com/MCLifeLeader/CIT261Team" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CIT261Team</a>, and
        <a href="https://github.com/MCLifeLeader/cs313php" target="_blank" rel="noopener">cs313php</a>.
    </p>
</section>
